></code></pre></div><p><strong>关键告警规则</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>阈值</th>\n<th>告警级别</th>\n<th>响应动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>指令遵循率下降</td>\n<td>&lt;90%（连续 5 分钟）</td>\n<td>P1</td>\n<td>自动回滚</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平均延迟增加</td>\n<td>&gt;2x 基线</td>\n<td>P2</td>\n<td>排查模型侧问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Token 消耗异常</td>\n<td>&gt;3x 历史均值</td>\n<td>P2</td>\n<td>检查提示膨胀</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误率上升</td>\n<td>&gt;5%</td>\n<td>P1</td>\n<td>自动回滚 + 告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本超预算</td>\n<td>日花费 &gt;130% 预算</td>\n<td>P3</td>\n<td>通知 Owner</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"提示漂移检测\">提示漂移检测</h2><p>模型更新是提示失效的最常见原因。即使提示文本未变，新版模型的行为差异可能导致输出质量悄悄下降（Silent Degradation）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class DriftDetector:&#10;    def __init__(self, baseline_metrics: dict, sensitivity: float = 0.15):&#10;        self.baseline = baseline_metrics&#10;        self.sensitivity = sensitivity&#10;&#10;    def check_drift(self, current_metrics: dict) -&gt; list[DriftAlert]:&#10;        alerts = []&#10;        for metric_name, baseline_value in self.baseline.items():&#10;            current_value = current_metrics.get(metric_name)&#10;            if current_value is None:&#10;                continue&#10;&#10;            relative_change = abs(current_value - baseline_value) / baseline_value&#10;            if relative_change &gt; self.sensitivity:&#10;                alerts.append(DriftAlert(&#10;                    metric=metric_name,&#10;                    baseline=baseline_value,&#10;                    current=current_value,&#10;                    drift_pct=relative_change * 100&#10;                ))&#10;        return alerts\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DriftDetector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, baseline_metrics: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, sensitivity: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.15</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.baseline </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> baseline_metrics</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.sensitivity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sensitivity</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> check_drift</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, current_metrics: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> list[DriftAlert]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        alerts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> metric_name, baseline_value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.baseline.items():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            current_value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current_metrics.get(metric_name)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current_value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">is</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                continue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            relative_change </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> abs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(current_value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> baseline_value) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> baseline_value</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> relative_change </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.sensitivity:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                alerts.append(DriftAlert(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">                    metric</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">metric_name,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">                    baseline</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">baseline_value,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">                    current</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">current_value,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">                    drift_pct</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">relative_change </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                ))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> alerts</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>定期健康检查</strong>：即使没有变更，每周对所有生产提示运行完整测试集，与历史基线对比。任何超过 15% 的偏差触发人工审查。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成本优化策略\">成本优化策略</h2><p>提示管理的一个被低估维度是成本控制。当月调用量达到百万级时，每个 token 都有业务影响：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>提示压缩</strong>：在不损失效果的前提下缩短系统提示（A/B 测试验证）</li>\n<li><strong>缓存策略</strong>：对确定性输出（相同输入→相同输出）的提示启用响应缓存</li>\n<li><strong>模型降级</strong>：非关键场景自动切换到更便宜的模型（如从 GPT-5.4 降级到 GPT-5.4-mini）</li>\n<li><strong>批处理</strong>：将可延迟的请求合批处理，利用批量折扣</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>提示是需要版本控制、测试、灰度发布和监控的生产级软件资产</li>\n<li>语义化版本 + 变更日志 + Owner 制度建立提示的治理框架</li>\n<li>A/B 测试是验证提示变更效果的唯一可靠方法</li>\n<li>实时监控覆盖遵循率、延迟、成本和错误率四大核心指标</li>\n<li>提示漂移检测防止模型更新导致的静默质量退化</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"prompt-security-and-injection\">提示安全与注入防御</a>——安全策略如何集成到提示管理的发布流程</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../llm-fine-tuning/deployment/production-pipeline\">生产部署管道</a>——从微调模型部署视角理解 ML 系统的生产化实践</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"生产级提示管理","id":"生产级提示管理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：提示即代码的管理范式","id":"核心概念-提示即代码的管理范式"},{"level":2,"text":"版本控制与提示注册中心","id":"版本控制与提示注册中心"},{"level":2,"text":"A/B 测试与灰度发布","id":"a-b-测试与灰度发布"},{"level":2,"text":"监控与可观测性","id":"监控与可观测性"},{"level":2,"text":"提示漂移检测","id":"提示漂移检测"},{"level":2,"text":"成本优化策略","id":"成本优化策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"提示安全与注入防御","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/prompt-engineering/practice/prompt-security-and-injection"},"next":{"title":"领域应用模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/prompt-engineering/practice/domain-specific-applications"}}